## Design Considerations
- **Privacy**: Encrypt SQLite at rest, use secure credential storage, and minimize data sent to servers
- **Performance**: Use batched writes, index wisely, and run sync on background threads to avoid blocking the main thread
- **Power Usage**: Schedule sync during charging or Wi-Fi, debounce frequent changes, and respect system low-power modes

